Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 13:24:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] Add NPU_TURBO config item and do code refine  - Add
 NPU_TURBO configuration to trade inference latency and power  consumption  -
 Reuse 'o/O' key for emergency exit and remove deploy ctr-c handling

Signed-off-by: Mao, Roger <roger.mao@intel.com>
